{"id":"628617","name":"黑胡椒土豆泥","author":"斌joanliu","authorId":"11138610","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/628617/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"土豆","amount":"3个"}],"sub":[{"name":"奶粉","amount":"5g"},{"name":"温水","amount":"50g"},{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"土豆准备好。","img":"images/628617/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"切成小块。","img":"images/628617/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"上蒸锅蒸熟。大概需要二十分钟。","img":"images/628617/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"奶粉用温水泡好。","img":"images/628617/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"所有调料混合均匀。","img":"images/628617/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"土豆蒸好，加盐和牛奶，用勺子压碎成泥。","img":"images/628617/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"再取小碗，放保鲜膜，放土豆泥，压紧。","img":"images/628617/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"定型好倒入盘中。","img":"images/628617/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"一共做了三个小坨坨。","img":"images/628617/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"锅预热，倒油。小火。","img":"images/628617/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"将调料再搅拌一下倒入锅中。","img":"images/628617/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"加热至冒泡。","img":"images/628617/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"将汁淋入土豆泥上。","img":"images/628617/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}